WEBVTT

01:13.300 --> 01:18.500
[Meet Yourself]

01:19.660 --> 01:23.740
[Episode 14]

01:29.252 --> 01:32.331
It's so outrageous in your village.

01:32.332 --> 01:34.251
This is totally a rumor.

01:34.252 --> 01:35.692
It's like truth in their mouths.

01:35.922 --> 01:38.842
The next rumor would be our one-month-old kid.

01:39.852 --> 01:41.282
This is the countryside.

01:41.642 --> 01:43.851
Today the topic is you,
tomorrow is someone else.

01:43.852 --> 01:45.132
They are credulous.

01:45.492 --> 01:49.332
Everything changed after being passed by them.

01:50.972 --> 01:53.331
The kids went to the yard to see you,

01:53.332 --> 01:54.611
what a good chance to refute!

01:54.612 --> 01:55.892
Why didn't you explain?

01:57.052 --> 01:58.161
What can I say?

01:58.162 --> 02:00.772
They would know who I am.

02:01.692 --> 02:03.132
What's your logic?

02:03.932 --> 02:08.532
You were so angry when Yuan wronged you
that you even tried to beat us.

02:09.162 --> 02:10.842
You are so exaggerated.

02:11.482 --> 02:14.132
Now you have the chance to explain,
but you don't.

02:16.602 --> 02:17.762
What to explain?

02:18.372 --> 02:19.842
I will leave several days later.

02:24.852 --> 02:26.002
We are coming!

02:26.602 --> 02:27.092
Here!

02:27.092 --> 02:28.132
I take Damai here.

02:29.602 --> 02:30.602
Come here, sit down.

02:30.882 --> 02:31.482
Guanjun.

02:31.483 --> 02:32.411
Two coca-cola.

02:32.412 --> 02:32.762
Okay.

02:32.762 --> 02:33.532
It's not ready yet.

02:33.533 --> 02:34.851
What are you talking about?

02:34.852 --> 02:38.882
We are talking about what can I do
when Xu Hongdou leaves.

02:39.972 --> 02:40.851
What?

02:40.852 --> 02:42.252
Just do what you should do.

02:42.972 --> 02:44.131
Hongdou, are you leaving?

02:44.132 --> 02:45.132
Not now.

02:45.762 --> 02:47.971
Then what does it mean
by saying what about Mr. Xie?

02:47.972 --> 02:50.322
You don't know what happened
between me and Xie Zhiyao?

02:51.972 --> 02:53.761
What happened to you two?

02:53.762 --> 02:54.762
Xu Hongdou,

02:55.252 --> 02:57.532
it sounds like you are making rumors yourself.

02:58.322 --> 02:59.322
What rumor?

03:02.762 --> 03:07.412
Now the saying goes that Hongdou
is President Xie's ex in Beijing.

03:07.762 --> 03:11.411
Now she comes back to Xie,
they not only reunited,

03:11.412 --> 03:13.692
but are going to get married as well.

03:16.042 --> 03:17.131
Then are you gonna get married?

03:17.132 --> 03:18.412
What do you think about it?

03:21.132 --> 03:24.252
I think you can.

03:25.532 --> 03:28.972
You two are qualified to get married.

03:29.692 --> 03:30.692
Why?

03:32.042 --> 03:33.042
Both single.

03:35.252 --> 03:36.811
I don't know that until you tell me.

03:36.812 --> 03:38.002
It sure is.

03:38.282 --> 03:39.282
That's true!

03:39.652 --> 03:43.371
There's a genre called married
before falling in love in romantic fictions.

03:43.372 --> 03:44.931
Many people love it.

03:44.932 --> 03:45.972
It's quite sweet.

03:48.652 --> 03:50.132
Stop sighing.

03:50.932 --> 03:52.441
Things would get better after I go.

03:52.442 --> 03:53.812
Be tough.

03:54.132 --> 03:55.811
How could you leave?

03:55.812 --> 03:58.764
If you leave, they will say

03:58.765 --> 04:04.812
Mr. Xie's girlfriend abandons him again
and leaves because of the countryside lifestyle.

04:05.252 --> 04:06.851
That makes sense.

04:06.852 --> 04:07.932
Xu Hongdou,

04:08.212 --> 04:09.971
you are so bad, too bad!

04:09.972 --> 04:11.522
How could I find a girlfriend later?

04:12.242 --> 04:16.281
Listen, if a woman dislikes you just because
you were put away by others,

04:16.282 --> 04:18.202
then she doesn't deserve your love.

04:18.852 --> 04:19.971
That makes sense.

04:19.972 --> 04:20.948
Right?

04:20.972 --> 04:21.972
Here.

04:23.012 --> 04:24.281
This is extra spicy.

04:24.282 --> 04:25.402
This one is normal.

04:32.362 --> 04:34.132
And these are the ones without spice.

04:34.412 --> 04:35.412
Thanks, boss.

04:35.922 --> 04:38.011
If you are married to Yao later someday,

04:38.012 --> 04:39.692
you are free to eat here.

04:39.972 --> 04:41.531
Really?

04:41.532 --> 04:44.011
I don't have this benefit,
but she has!

04:44.012 --> 04:45.801
It's on me.

04:45.802 --> 04:47.032
Mind your own business.

04:51.242 --> 04:53.642
I won't go to the store tomorrow.

04:54.122 --> 04:54.851
Why?

04:54.852 --> 04:55.721
I'll go out.

04:55.722 --> 04:56.651
With who?

04:56.652 --> 04:57.652
Them.

04:58.572 --> 04:59.812
Tomorrow is my day off too.

05:00.412 --> 05:03.531
Damai always stays at home,
no one could ask her out.

05:03.532 --> 05:06.361
Now she asks to go out with others,

05:06.362 --> 05:07.852
of course, we have to satisfy her.

05:11.362 --> 05:12.362
Okay, fine.

06:49.452 --> 06:51.492
This color is not bright enough.

06:51.892 --> 06:53.852
It's too simple.

06:54.892 --> 06:56.211
Then let's make a hot silver version.

06:56.212 --> 06:57.211
Better on quality.

06:57.212 --> 06:58.212
What about hollow?

06:58.652 --> 07:00.451
The paper tape is hollowed.

07:00.452 --> 07:01.771
The box is still simple.

07:01.772 --> 07:03.011
I'll make a sample and show you.

07:03.012 --> 07:04.012
Okay.

07:08.332 --> 07:09.771
Hello, bro?

07:09.772 --> 07:10.772
What?

07:14.332 --> 07:15.211
Okay, calm down.

07:15.212 --> 07:16.212
I'll be right there.

07:18.012 --> 07:18.971
What's wrong?

07:18.972 --> 07:20.152
It's okay, I'll be right back.

07:28.972 --> 07:31.651
Give us money, money, money!

07:31.652 --> 07:32.412
No, no.

07:32.413 --> 07:34.211
Listen to me.

07:34.212 --> 07:34.971
Calm down.

07:34.972 --> 07:38.241
This is gonna be settled sooner or later.

07:38.242 --> 07:41.571
It would be no use even if you ruin this.

07:41.572 --> 07:43.091
You suddenly shut down the project,

07:43.092 --> 07:45.331
and delayed our two-month wages.

07:45.332 --> 07:46.891
Now we can't see our boss.

07:46.892 --> 07:47.891
What could we do?

07:47.892 --> 07:50.971
Your boss called me,
he is raising funds.

07:50.972 --> 07:53.571
Fine, then ask him to pay us.

07:53.572 --> 07:54.332
Right?

07:54.332 --> 07:54.572
Yes!

07:54.573 --> 07:55.891
Pay us! Pay us! We have to eat!

07:55.892 --> 07:56.891
Shouldn't the committee take charge of it?

07:56.892 --> 07:59.241
You went to the committee,
and you guys know,

07:59.242 --> 08:01.091
the secretary and director are out
for a meeting today.

08:01.092 --> 08:02.411
We are not ignoring you.

08:02.412 --> 08:03.891
Don't talk like a bureaucrat, give us money!

08:03.892 --> 08:05.651
It is natural to pay back debts!

08:05.652 --> 08:08.172
Pay us, pay us!

08:17.892 --> 08:19.891
Okay, okay.

08:19.892 --> 08:20.892
Thanks.

08:23.682 --> 08:25.651
Pay it back! Pay it back! Pay it back!

08:25.652 --> 08:26.732
Stop talking nonsense!

08:27.002 --> 08:27.641
Xie.

08:27.642 --> 08:28.881
Xie, Xie, Xie!

08:28.882 --> 08:30.211
Hold on, everybody. Hold on.

08:30.212 --> 08:31.761
Yao is here, listen to him.

08:31.762 --> 08:33.761
Why are you surrendering Huang?

08:33.762 --> 08:35.732
Don't shout at a girl.

08:36.452 --> 08:37.851
Settle the problem first. Come on.

08:37.852 --> 08:39.162
Come on, have a smoke, bro.

08:39.402 --> 08:40.091
Come on.

08:40.092 --> 08:41.282
Come on, take a cigarette.

08:43.212 --> 08:44.091
Bro.

08:44.092 --> 08:46.851
I stopped doing anything and ran here
as soon as I got your phone call.

08:46.852 --> 08:48.121
Let's settle the problem.

08:48.122 --> 08:49.372
Don't be angry, okay?

08:50.522 --> 08:51.241
Yao.

08:51.242 --> 08:52.571
The boss went away.

08:52.572 --> 08:53.972
But he didn't pay us money.

08:55.642 --> 08:59.211
Okay, as for the wages, I settle it.

08:59.212 --> 09:02.001
The boss invested millions in this homestay.

09:02.002 --> 09:03.551
The rest worth hundreds of thousand yuan.

09:03.552 --> 09:05.401
A monk may run away,
but the temple remains, right?

09:05.402 --> 09:08.451
Yes, you see how much this is
and how much your wage is?

09:08.452 --> 09:10.612
No one can leave this alone.

09:10.882 --> 09:12.331
Then pay us first.

09:12.332 --> 09:14.091
Yes, just pay us!

09:14.092 --> 09:15.971
Where's the money? Give us the money!

09:15.972 --> 09:16.931
Fine, fine.

09:16.932 --> 09:17.932
Wait...

09:19.402 --> 09:20.402
Yao.

09:20.642 --> 09:22.881
You led us to build this homestay.

09:22.882 --> 09:23.401
Yes.

09:23.402 --> 09:24.971
Huang Xinxin is the guarantor.

09:24.972 --> 09:27.162
You can't stay away from this.

09:27.762 --> 09:31.132
Actually, we would not agree
even if it's one month later.

09:31.642 --> 09:33.451
But the boss was quite nice to us.

09:33.452 --> 09:35.641
We can understand his difficulty.

09:35.642 --> 09:39.042
We kept working even though
he delayed our wages.

09:39.332 --> 09:42.282
Now even if he really is raising the fund,

09:42.572 --> 09:44.682
then how long should we wait?

09:45.002 --> 09:47.241
Whether should we accept other works or not?

09:47.242 --> 09:48.802
Should we keep on waiting?

09:49.092 --> 09:50.612
No one gives us an answer.

09:51.212 --> 09:52.522
You are right.

09:52.882 --> 09:56.732
The project of the homestay
near the airport was higher in pay,

09:57.332 --> 10:00.571
you told us that this is near to our home,

10:00.572 --> 10:02.612
and we can go back home if we choose this.

10:03.852 --> 10:07.361
And this is good for our village later.

10:07.362 --> 10:08.851
We listened to you.

10:08.852 --> 10:10.851
But the boss is away now.

10:10.852 --> 10:11.972
We don't even get paid.

10:12.212 --> 10:13.972
What should we do?

10:15.812 --> 10:17.972
Bro, believe me.

10:18.212 --> 10:21.331
Huang and I will settle this
right away for you.

10:21.332 --> 10:23.452
I will find you later in the evening
to solve this, okay?

10:27.092 --> 10:29.571
I know what you are thinking about.

10:29.572 --> 10:30.691
You are all right.

10:30.692 --> 10:33.811
But we can't solve this
just standing here together.

10:33.812 --> 10:34.212
Okay?

10:34.213 --> 10:36.691
We have to find a solution to pay you the wages.

10:36.692 --> 10:37.721
Are you okay with this?

10:37.722 --> 10:39.931
Yao is a boss.

10:39.932 --> 10:41.851
So he is good at speaking for bosses.

10:41.852 --> 10:44.882
Now he is just cheating us back,
and shutting our mouths up.

10:45.482 --> 10:47.851
People are here to get their wages back,

10:47.852 --> 10:50.252
why are they acting up in your words?

10:51.092 --> 10:57.372
No matter which way you use to seek your wages,
you have to wait.

10:58.212 --> 10:59.882
Then give us the money!

11:00.212 --> 11:01.331
You silly boy!

11:01.332 --> 11:02.091
Uncle.

11:02.092 --> 11:03.721
Is it Yao or the committee that owes you?

11:03.722 --> 11:04.722
Silly boy!

11:04.972 --> 11:06.571
Uncle, don't kick him.

11:06.572 --> 11:08.211
He did his work but didn't get his money,

11:08.212 --> 11:08.972
he is not feeling good.

11:08.973 --> 11:10.211
I can understand.

11:10.212 --> 11:10.811
Yes.

11:10.812 --> 11:12.252
I would be angry too if it was me.

11:13.722 --> 11:14.851
Just go.

11:14.852 --> 11:15.931
Just go.

11:15.932 --> 11:16.851
Don't stay here.

11:16.852 --> 11:17.852
It's so hot here.

11:18.172 --> 11:20.002
Today you still have your wages, okay?

11:20.482 --> 11:21.601
Okay? Just wait for the notice.

11:21.602 --> 11:22.211
Okay?

11:22.212 --> 11:23.212
Let's go. Back home.

11:23.452 --> 11:25.091
Let's go guys.

11:25.092 --> 11:26.091
Wait for the notice.

11:26.092 --> 11:27.452
Go, go, let's go.

11:28.092 --> 11:29.051
Take a cigarette?

11:29.052 --> 11:30.492
Come on, let's go.

11:32.452 --> 11:33.572
Wait for the notice.

11:35.092 --> 11:36.092
Bro.

11:36.572 --> 11:37.712
Take a cigarette.

11:40.212 --> 11:41.212
Yao.

11:42.482 --> 11:43.552
I believe in you.

11:56.852 --> 11:58.492
Take it easy!

12:05.212 --> 12:06.572
It's such a coincidence!

12:07.362 --> 12:09.451
The secretary and director were both away,

12:09.452 --> 12:12.451
I called the director,
and he asked me to take a look there.

12:12.452 --> 12:14.211
No one listened to me when I arrived.

12:14.212 --> 12:15.691
I just have one mouth,

12:15.692 --> 12:18.331
how could I make it to persuade so many people?

12:18.332 --> 12:20.492
I am just dry and thirsty to death now.

12:22.452 --> 12:24.252
What's wrong with the boss?

12:24.572 --> 12:25.852
Did he really go bankrupt?

12:26.572 --> 12:28.091
I called him.

12:28.092 --> 12:29.612
He said he was raising the fund.

12:31.852 --> 12:33.571
He has spent so much on this house,

12:33.572 --> 12:35.091
even if he really went bankrupt,

12:35.092 --> 12:37.972
he should come back and try to sell the house.

12:39.292 --> 12:41.642
It's not easy to sell it.

12:44.722 --> 12:47.612
If Shaohua Bookstore was here,
it would be easier to sell it.

12:50.092 --> 12:52.882
When would your senior apprentice
who learns photography come?

12:53.572 --> 12:55.612
She said she would be here after a shooting.

12:56.572 --> 12:57.572
Okay.

13:00.452 --> 13:01.612
Where is your Xu Hongdou?

13:02.052 --> 13:03.091
Playing outside.

13:03.092 --> 13:04.452
What? My Hongdou?

13:05.452 --> 13:07.211
You are getting married,
don't you know?

13:07.212 --> 13:08.372
I don't know.

13:12.972 --> 13:13.972
Qin.

13:20.572 --> 13:21.572
What's wrong?

13:21.812 --> 13:23.451
Your dad scolded you again?

13:23.452 --> 13:24.882
Scanning through WeChat.

13:33.092 --> 13:33.851
Yao.

13:33.852 --> 13:36.601
You told me on WeChat that all the messages
about you getting married were rumors.

13:36.602 --> 13:37.612
Is that real?

13:38.692 --> 13:39.732
Yes.

13:40.172 --> 13:41.452
Call me Uncle Yao.

13:44.212 --> 13:45.642
Then can you marry me?

13:49.362 --> 13:50.492
Of course not.

13:50.852 --> 13:52.091
Why?

13:52.092 --> 13:54.571
You don't like my low education background
without any skill,

13:54.572 --> 13:55.572
right?

13:57.362 --> 13:58.362
Qin,

13:58.692 --> 14:01.051
when I was in middle school,
you were just a little girl,

14:01.052 --> 14:02.361
I held you at that time.

14:02.362 --> 14:03.211
Then I started working,

14:03.212 --> 14:05.091
I gave you gift money each year
when I came back.

14:05.092 --> 14:06.092
Remember?

14:06.332 --> 14:08.691
Some men just like younger girls.

14:08.692 --> 14:11.732
On TV some male stars
are 12 years older than their wives.

14:12.092 --> 14:13.572
Right? Xinxin.

14:17.212 --> 14:18.642
Yes, yes.

14:19.332 --> 14:20.308
Yes.

14:20.332 --> 14:22.931
But your uncle Yao likes girls
who are his age.

14:22.932 --> 14:24.002
They can share topics.

14:24.572 --> 14:26.171
What topic?

14:26.172 --> 14:28.732
We share everything
after being together for long.

14:29.572 --> 14:32.851
A common topic is not something related to time.

14:32.852 --> 14:36.852
It's a spiritual thing.

14:39.452 --> 14:40.452
I don't know.

14:42.212 --> 14:43.171
Yao.

14:43.172 --> 14:44.882
I give you one last chance.

14:45.212 --> 14:47.732
If I go to learn stitch-work,
would you consider me?

14:50.482 --> 14:51.482
No.

14:52.972 --> 14:55.171
Fine, then I won't consider you, either.

14:55.172 --> 14:56.372
Someone is pursuing me.

14:59.812 --> 15:02.492
By the way, call me Candy!

15:05.972 --> 15:07.372
Bye, Candy.

15:08.332 --> 15:09.452
Candy...

15:13.852 --> 15:17.851
I told Daxia to check and send me all the sites
under construction around our village.

15:17.852 --> 15:19.211
We can go and ask each of them.

15:19.212 --> 15:20.252
Okay, go.

16:21.932 --> 16:22.932
Hu.

16:23.452 --> 16:23.972
I'm here.

16:23.972 --> 16:24.722
Here, here.

16:24.722 --> 16:25.362
Come on.

16:25.362 --> 16:26.092
Welcome!

16:26.092 --> 16:26.572
Hello!

16:26.572 --> 16:27.572
This way, please.

16:28.572 --> 16:29.331
Here. Here.

16:29.332 --> 16:30.601
Let me introduce.

16:30.602 --> 16:33.091
They are the three beauties of our courtyard.

16:33.092 --> 16:35.571
Nana, Hongdou and Sis Damai.

16:35.572 --> 16:36.451
Hello.

16:36.452 --> 16:38.211
This is my friend Maque.

16:38.212 --> 16:40.762
She and her husband are the bosses of this bar.

16:41.332 --> 16:42.851
We would come when we have a party.

16:42.852 --> 16:46.332
It feels good to drink and boast here.

16:46.852 --> 16:47.851
Okay, have fun.

16:47.852 --> 16:48.851
I'll prepare back there.

16:48.852 --> 16:49.852
Thanks.

16:49.972 --> 16:50.972
Thanks a lot.

16:54.452 --> 16:55.852
What would you like to drink?

17:07.682 --> 17:09.482
Here, let me serve you the cocktail.

17:12.362 --> 17:13.201
Enjoy.

17:13.202 --> 17:13.732
Thanks.

17:13.732 --> 17:14.491
You're welcome.

17:14.492 --> 17:15.492
Come on.

17:15.922 --> 17:17.681
Cheers.

17:17.682 --> 17:20.811
♫ That day in 1994 ♫

17:20.812 --> 17:24.091
♫ the first day you come to this world ♫

17:24.092 --> 17:25.681
♫ the rain stopped ♫

17:25.682 --> 17:28.571
♫ your father gave you the name ♫

17:28.572 --> 17:30.012
♫ called Zhou Qingtian ♫

17:30.442 --> 17:33.132
♫ Days passed ♫

17:33.602 --> 17:36.202
♫ you grew up ♫

17:36.682 --> 17:39.851
♫ You experienced ups and downs ♫

17:39.852 --> 17:43.372
♫ It will all pass ♫

17:44.202 --> 17:47.331
♫ You are just 28 years old after all ♫

17:47.332 --> 17:50.852
♫ You will live a great life later ♫

17:51.162 --> 17:52.961
♫ Zhou Qingtian ♫

17:52.962 --> 17:56.361
♫ it will all be sunny days in your future ♫

17:56.362 --> 17:59.601
♫ You are just 28 years old after all ♫

17:59.602 --> 18:03.331
♫ You will live a great life later ♫

18:03.332 --> 18:05.091
♫ Zhou Qingtian ♫

18:05.092 --> 18:08.612
♫ it will all be sunny days in your future ♫

18:10.332 --> 18:14.331
♫ Happy birthday to you ♫

18:14.332 --> 18:18.331
♫ Happy birthday to you ♫

18:18.332 --> 18:22.851
♫ Happy birthday to you ♫

18:22.852 --> 18:28.731
♫ Happy birthday to you ♫

18:28.732 --> 18:29.571
♫ Happy birthday ♫

18:29.572 --> 18:30.772
♫ Happy birthday ♫

18:31.292 --> 18:32.292
Come on, come on.

18:32.362 --> 18:33.491
Make a wish.

18:33.492 --> 18:34.492
Yes.

18:48.092 --> 18:49.161
Happy birthday!

18:49.162 --> 18:50.491
I didn't blow off my candles.

18:50.492 --> 18:51.641
Let's blow it together.

18:51.642 --> 18:52.922
One, two, three.

18:57.772 --> 18:59.531
I saw your identity card,

18:59.532 --> 19:01.531
we wanted to give you a birthday party.

19:01.532 --> 19:03.091
But we didn't expect that you asked us first.

19:03.092 --> 19:04.531
And you didn't tell us.

19:04.532 --> 19:09.121
So Hongdou and I decided to just let it be
and pretend to know nothing about it.

19:09.122 --> 19:10.612
And then give you a big surprise.

19:11.682 --> 19:12.401
I am surprised.

19:12.402 --> 19:14.642
Sis Damai, happy birthday!

19:15.602 --> 19:16.852
Thanks, Mr. Hu.

19:17.252 --> 19:18.912
It's my honor, I should do that.

19:20.122 --> 19:21.331
Thanks, Mr. Hu.

19:21.332 --> 19:22.601
Don't say thanks.

19:22.602 --> 19:24.331
We live in the same yard,
we are family.

19:24.332 --> 19:25.091
You're welcome.

19:25.092 --> 19:26.531
To Mr. Hu!

19:26.532 --> 19:27.532
I'll finish this.

19:30.402 --> 19:31.641
You... you...

19:31.642 --> 19:33.132
Then I will finish this too.

19:38.252 --> 19:40.571
Then I'll call the workers here tomorrow.
Thanks.

19:40.572 --> 19:41.251
Okay.

19:41.252 --> 19:44.372
We ask for a leave to the singing party,
we are short on casual labor.

19:44.602 --> 19:46.531
Confirm one more time,
pay day by day?

19:46.532 --> 19:47.851
Yes, paying day by day.

19:47.852 --> 19:48.052
Okay.

19:48.052 --> 19:49.052
Good.

19:49.572 --> 19:50.601
You don't have to walk us off.

19:50.602 --> 19:51.641
Mind your business.

19:51.642 --> 19:52.092
Okay.

19:52.093 --> 19:53.161
Then take care.

19:53.162 --> 19:53.882
Bye, take care.

19:53.883 --> 19:55.162
Thanks, bye.

19:56.122 --> 19:57.491
Okay, I'll treat you to lunch.

19:57.492 --> 19:58.492
I'm good.

19:58.572 --> 19:59.772
I will send you back.

20:00.012 --> 20:02.372
Those three are drinking outside,
I have to pick them up.

20:03.012 --> 20:04.012
Okay.

20:05.572 --> 20:08.612
Again in Retrospect to my friends.

20:20.052 --> 20:23.012
♫ When I look back ♫

20:23.532 --> 20:26.612
♫ the cloud covers my way ♫

20:26.882 --> 20:29.051
♫ When I look back ♫

20:29.052 --> 20:33.332
♫ thorns are all over the road ♫

20:33.602 --> 20:40.162
♫ I have no old dreams hard to let go tonight ♫

20:40.922 --> 20:44.092
♫ The dream about you ♫

20:44.332 --> 20:47.402
♫ who can I tell later ♫

20:47.852 --> 20:49.852
♫ When I look back ♫

20:50.852 --> 20:53.162
♫ you have gone far ♫

20:54.252 --> 20:56.162
♫ When I look back ♫

20:56.492 --> 21:00.572
♫ tears are in my eyes ♫

21:01.012 --> 21:04.132
♫ Leave your blessing to me ♫

21:04.922 --> 21:07.532
♫ warm me on this cold night. ♫

21:08.122 --> 21:14.401
♫ No matter how much sorrow
and the puzzle is waiting for me tomorrow ♫

21:14.402 --> 21:20.092
♫ I asked again and again in the dark night ♫

21:20.852 --> 21:26.132
♫ then I know that ordinary life is true ♫

21:27.402 --> 21:30.491
♫ It's like a dream when I look back ♫

21:30.492 --> 21:33.572
♫ I still love you when I look back ♫

21:33.852 --> 21:37.961
♫ Only the long road ♫

21:37.962 --> 21:41.242
♫ is still with me ♫

21:46.092 --> 21:48.852
Hongdou,
what do we look like when we are old?

21:49.362 --> 21:50.852
Just an old woman.

21:51.092 --> 21:56.442
No, I mean could we still eat fruits and
play together like this when we are old?

21:56.852 --> 21:58.121
Of course.

21:58.122 --> 22:00.552
We can go to the Tian'anmen Square
to watch the flag raising.

22:02.162 --> 22:05.162
Then I'm going to a disco dancing
until I get a fracture.

22:06.402 --> 22:07.811
I will buy calcium pills for you.

22:07.812 --> 22:09.091
I can buy hair dye for you.

22:09.092 --> 22:10.292
I'll buy you a walking stick.

22:10.572 --> 22:12.331
I'll buy you an electric wheelchair.

22:12.332 --> 22:13.612
You are so generous!

22:14.852 --> 22:16.532
Your grandson's tuition fee is on me.

22:18.572 --> 22:20.572
You're so generous, Grandma Hongdou.

22:21.252 --> 22:23.402
Then I'll say thank you to Zheng Xiaobao.

22:23.772 --> 22:24.922
Zheng Xiaobao?

22:26.572 --> 22:28.011
You two are just together for two weeks.

22:28.012 --> 22:28.881
Right?

22:28.882 --> 22:29.881
Zheng Xiaobao?

22:29.882 --> 22:30.882
Aren't you shy?

22:31.252 --> 22:32.251
You are so bad!

22:32.252 --> 22:33.642
Don't laugh, don't laugh!

22:33.882 --> 22:34.882
You can't laugh!

22:35.362 --> 22:36.601
Stop talking nonsense.

22:36.602 --> 22:37.362
I didn't.

22:37.363 --> 22:38.571
That's the truth, okay?

22:38.572 --> 22:39.771
I don't allow you to say that.

22:39.772 --> 22:40.012
No!

22:40.012 --> 22:40.641
Go away!

22:40.642 --> 22:41.642
No!

22:45.402 --> 22:48.532
♫ It's like a dream when I look back, ♫

22:48.852 --> 22:51.852
♫ I still love you when I look back. ♫

22:52.332 --> 22:56.091
♫ Only the long road, ♫

22:56.092 --> 22:59.052
♫ is still with me. ♫

23:07.772 --> 23:09.812
You're so good!

23:10.602 --> 23:11.922
This is mine, this is mine.

23:12.252 --> 23:12.532
Yours?

23:12.533 --> 23:13.401
This is mine, yes.

23:13.402 --> 23:14.572
I was sitting there.

23:16.852 --> 23:20.682
I think... I think you two can make a group,

23:21.332 --> 23:23.121
called Spicy Soup.

23:23.122 --> 23:24.811
What Spicy Soup?

23:24.812 --> 23:27.771
We call Nana Lala in our accent.

23:27.772 --> 23:31.202
We can't differentiate ne and le.

23:32.642 --> 23:36.852
So I think apart from Spicy Soup,
Hula Hoop also works for you two.

23:38.732 --> 23:40.571
Sis Damai, are you drunk?

23:40.572 --> 23:41.601
Stop drinking.

23:41.602 --> 23:42.602
I'm not.

23:47.812 --> 23:48.812
Mr. Hu.

23:49.092 --> 23:50.092
What?

23:50.402 --> 23:53.922
I felt that you were a naughty guy before.

23:55.812 --> 23:58.011
But today I'm sorry for that,
I'll drink this.

23:58.012 --> 23:59.331
No, no, Sis...

23:59.332 --> 24:00.812
don't drink it, I can drink...

24:11.492 --> 24:12.401
So?

24:12.402 --> 24:15.531
She just said I was naughty,
she is drunk now?

24:15.532 --> 24:16.612
She is drunk.

24:18.492 --> 24:19.492
Damai.

24:22.092 --> 24:23.092
President Xie.

24:24.052 --> 24:25.532
Where? Parking lot, right?

24:26.122 --> 24:27.442
Okay. Okay.

24:28.292 --> 24:29.332
I'll hang up.

24:37.882 --> 24:38.882
Damai.

24:39.092 --> 24:39.572
We're going.

24:39.573 --> 24:40.401
Hello.

24:40.402 --> 24:43.372
Are you that Singer Nana?

24:44.532 --> 24:46.332
I'm not, you get the wrong person.

24:48.602 --> 24:49.731
Sorry.

24:49.732 --> 24:50.732
It's okay.

25:03.092 --> 25:04.612
What's wrong with her, drunk?

25:04.882 --> 25:05.922
Yes, she is drunk.

25:06.162 --> 25:07.161
Mr. Xie is at the parking lot.

25:07.162 --> 25:07.731
Let's go.

25:07.732 --> 25:08.162
Go.

25:08.162 --> 25:08.732
I will pay the bill.

25:08.733 --> 25:10.491
I've already paid.

25:10.492 --> 25:11.331
I'm so sorry about that.

25:11.332 --> 25:13.052
Why?

25:13.852 --> 25:14.571
Let's go.

25:14.572 --> 25:15.091
Fine.

25:15.092 --> 25:18.332
What about Damai?

25:19.332 --> 25:19.731
Here.

25:19.732 --> 25:20.601
I'm not drunk.

25:20.602 --> 25:21.531
You're not?

25:21.532 --> 25:21.922
Okay, okay.

25:21.923 --> 25:23.851
You're not, you're not drunk. Let's go.

25:23.852 --> 25:24.642
Xie Zhiyao is coming.

25:24.642 --> 25:25.292
Let's go.

25:25.293 --> 25:26.491
Why does he come to pick us?

25:26.492 --> 25:27.641
We can't drive after drinking.

25:27.642 --> 25:28.851
You two take care of her.

25:28.852 --> 25:29.731
Watch out.

25:29.732 --> 25:30.812
I will go after you.

25:31.642 --> 25:34.531
My dad doesn't allow me
to find a boyfriend out of town.

25:34.532 --> 25:35.851
Okay, okay.

25:35.852 --> 25:37.372
Why is she like this when she is drunk?

25:39.052 --> 25:41.912
Every spring festival
when my relatives reunited at home,

25:42.158 --> 25:43.641
they said they would find me a husband.

25:43.642 --> 25:44.851
And let me have two babies.

25:44.852 --> 25:46.121
Two babies!

25:46.122 --> 25:48.161
I don't even have a boyfriend.

25:48.162 --> 25:50.132
Two babies!

25:50.492 --> 25:51.092
Be careful!

25:51.093 --> 25:52.442
My aunt was ridiculous,

25:52.812 --> 25:54.251
she was crazy.

25:54.252 --> 25:56.771
She took that guy to my home.

25:56.772 --> 25:57.681
This way, this way.

25:57.682 --> 25:58.682
My god.

25:58.922 --> 25:59.602
Take care.

25:59.603 --> 26:01.331
I just woke up without washing my face...

26:01.332 --> 26:02.612
Mr. Hu, this way...

26:03.252 --> 26:03.852
I'm fine, I'm fine.

26:03.853 --> 26:05.331
In the sitting room, I'm alive.

26:05.332 --> 26:08.372
There's a guy in his business suit with a tie.

26:08.922 --> 26:10.772
He's like a sales manager.

26:11.922 --> 26:13.332
Why did she drink so much?

26:13.642 --> 26:17.051
Nana said that the cocktail is strong.

26:17.052 --> 26:21.162
I just woke up without brushing my teeth,

26:21.602 --> 26:23.332
how could I have romantic love?

26:25.092 --> 26:27.291
Your aunt was ridiculous.

26:27.292 --> 26:28.161
Let's get in the car first.

26:28.162 --> 26:28.642
Get in the car.

26:28.643 --> 26:32.491
But dating needs to hang out.

26:32.492 --> 26:37.852
Each time we hang out,
we will always go to the milk tea shop

26:38.092 --> 26:41.491
It was from July to August, so hot...

26:41.492 --> 26:42.492
Mr. Hu!

26:42.732 --> 26:43.492
Get in the car.

26:43.492 --> 26:44.492
Do you know?

26:44.602 --> 26:46.852
We go to the milk tea shop each time we date.

26:48.092 --> 26:51.292
It's so hot in July and August!

26:51.642 --> 26:52.642
Xu Hongdou,

26:53.252 --> 26:54.292
get in the car.

27:04.162 --> 27:05.332
Get on.

27:08.492 --> 27:11.092
I have nothing to talk about with him.

27:11.572 --> 27:13.202
Do you know what he said to me?

27:13.602 --> 27:15.372
He said that he earned ten grand a month.

27:15.642 --> 27:18.092
Then he asked me that
how much I earn by writing online.

27:18.532 --> 27:20.132
I said ten grand too.

27:21.642 --> 27:22.681
Guess what he said next.

27:22.682 --> 27:23.682
Nana.

27:23.812 --> 27:24.122
He said...

27:24.123 --> 27:25.331
Fasten her seat belt.

27:25.332 --> 27:25.851
Okay.

27:25.852 --> 27:27.612
Give me your account.

27:27.852 --> 27:28.852
Xu Hongdou.

27:29.092 --> 27:30.612
Fasten your seat belt.

27:31.572 --> 27:32.811
Why should I give him my account?

27:32.812 --> 27:34.201
Seat belt.

27:34.202 --> 27:35.722
It's ridiculous.

27:39.602 --> 27:41.532
Fortunately, I was ready for that.

27:44.732 --> 27:46.572
Didn't you find that Xu Hongdou was drunk too?

27:47.492 --> 27:49.361
Then play Truth or Dare with her!

27:49.362 --> 27:51.442
We haven't gone that far,
you know?

27:52.122 --> 27:54.051
We just met.

27:54.052 --> 27:55.051
And chat.

27:55.052 --> 27:56.291
We would just be friends.

27:56.292 --> 27:57.292
Right?

27:57.332 --> 27:58.922
You know what he said to me?

27:59.362 --> 28:04.291
He said that I could move to his place
when the day is good.

28:04.292 --> 28:06.161
Why should I live with him?

28:06.162 --> 28:09.372
He said he would give me half his closet
for my clothes.

28:13.292 --> 28:15.361
We just met, okay?

28:15.362 --> 28:16.362
Yes.

28:16.812 --> 28:19.161
You have to rain!

28:19.162 --> 28:21.051
I want rain for a whole year!

28:21.052 --> 28:21.921
You hear me?

28:21.922 --> 28:22.922
Mr. Hu.

28:23.602 --> 28:25.491
There's a plush toy on the back seat.

28:25.492 --> 28:26.812
Pass it to me.

28:27.122 --> 28:28.122
Okay.

28:29.882 --> 28:31.202
It's okay, it's okay.

28:35.772 --> 28:39.162
Why do you have this on your car?

28:40.012 --> 28:41.642
Hulu dropped it here.

28:42.092 --> 28:43.092
Come on.

28:43.122 --> 28:46.442
My mom likes the girls
who don't do makeup like you.

28:49.682 --> 28:51.961
I laughed.

28:51.962 --> 28:53.401
Then I bought a model kit.

28:53.402 --> 28:54.722
Guess how much was it?

28:55.602 --> 28:56.812
2800 yuan.

28:57.682 --> 28:58.811
That was so expensive!

28:58.812 --> 28:59.641
Was it?

28:59.642 --> 29:01.491
It's just a model kit of 2800 yuan.

29:01.492 --> 29:02.612
Expensive?

29:04.092 --> 29:05.251
Just a little model kit.

29:05.252 --> 29:06.252
She is crying?

29:06.402 --> 29:08.401
Play Truth or Dare with her.

29:08.402 --> 29:10.091
What Truth or Dare!

29:10.092 --> 29:10.602
I was scared...

29:10.602 --> 29:11.602
You don't know.

29:11.642 --> 29:13.731
That man wanted to break up with me,

29:13.732 --> 29:15.331
he even asked me for the milk tea money.

29:15.332 --> 29:15.812
What?

29:15.813 --> 29:17.161
I know that!

29:17.162 --> 29:20.851
The day he bought me the milk tea,
he used the coupon.

29:20.852 --> 29:21.252
You know?

29:21.252 --> 29:21.852
He didn't pay.

29:21.852 --> 29:22.922
What was he doing?

29:23.332 --> 29:24.731
Then he said...

29:24.732 --> 29:26.642
I won't ask you for the bus fare.

29:28.162 --> 29:31.012
Then my father forced me to run,

29:31.732 --> 29:33.532
and then asked me to find a job.

29:34.402 --> 29:36.852
I have no thought of that.

29:47.882 --> 29:50.091
Damai doesn't talk much ordinarily.

29:50.092 --> 29:51.112
You need to talk.

29:54.642 --> 29:55.642
It's cool.

29:56.332 --> 29:57.531
My mom says the same.

29:57.532 --> 29:58.292
So that's it.

29:58.293 --> 30:00.572
You should chat with us.

30:01.572 --> 30:02.572
It feels so good.

30:03.812 --> 30:05.601
If you were not drunk,

30:05.602 --> 30:12.121
we would never know about your relatives,
aunt, your date,

30:12.122 --> 30:13.731
your 2800 yuan model kits,

30:13.732 --> 30:15.372
and your dad forcing you to run...

30:16.402 --> 30:17.402
So good!

30:18.362 --> 30:19.642
I would never drink later.

30:20.402 --> 30:21.812
And Hongdou.

30:23.252 --> 30:24.811
Hongdou was even more ridiculous.

30:24.812 --> 30:26.372
She sat there crying all the time.

30:26.922 --> 30:28.331
And listen to Again in Retrospect.

30:28.332 --> 30:29.571
And again and again.

30:29.572 --> 30:31.162
And crying all the time.

30:34.772 --> 30:38.121
Oh yes, that fluffy rabbit which
was cried wet by you was Hulu's.

30:38.122 --> 30:40.682
Remember to wash it,
and give it back to Mr. Xie.

30:44.572 --> 30:45.852
I want to go home.

30:53.332 --> 30:54.332
Sausage.

30:59.852 --> 31:00.572
Where are you going?

31:00.573 --> 31:01.811
I'll collect the clothes.

31:01.812 --> 31:02.851
Do it later.

31:02.852 --> 31:03.402
Eat first.

31:03.403 --> 31:04.401
Or it will get cold later.

31:04.402 --> 31:05.291
Don't mind it.

31:05.292 --> 31:06.331
I'll do it.

31:06.332 --> 31:07.851
I can do it after the meal.

31:07.852 --> 31:09.332
Leave it to me.

31:09.572 --> 31:11.052
So many clothes...

31:11.492 --> 31:12.092
Mom.

31:12.092 --> 31:13.068
Sister.

31:13.092 --> 31:13.732
Leave her alone.

31:13.733 --> 31:14.952
She doesn't listen to you.

31:15.572 --> 31:17.091
Don't say that.

31:17.092 --> 31:18.361
Do you listen to me?

31:18.362 --> 31:21.642
Didn't I tell you not to call Luo Quan?

31:21.882 --> 31:22.731
I didn't.

31:22.732 --> 31:24.401
He sent messages to me on WeChat.

31:24.402 --> 31:25.772
He sent messages to me too.

31:26.572 --> 31:27.292
You replied to him,

31:27.293 --> 31:28.771
of course, he would keep
sending messages to you.

31:28.772 --> 31:30.641
If you don't reply,
would he send anything to you?

31:30.642 --> 31:32.092
I didn't reply.

31:32.852 --> 31:34.402
But you liked his moment.

31:35.252 --> 31:36.571
He liked mine.

31:36.572 --> 31:38.292
Could you block him?

31:39.012 --> 31:42.012
I share nothing secret,
why should I block?

31:44.852 --> 31:47.921
You can't see Luo Quan as our relative,

31:47.922 --> 31:49.361
he will get married later.

31:49.362 --> 31:51.161
If he always contacts his ex-wife's family,

31:51.162 --> 31:53.571
what would his wife think?

31:53.572 --> 31:54.851
We should at least do some window dressing...

31:54.852 --> 31:56.162
You are too much.

31:56.922 --> 31:57.332
Mom.

31:57.333 --> 31:59.402
Are you angry?

32:02.332 --> 32:03.772
No, I'm not.

32:04.092 --> 32:06.372
Then why are you being so furious?

32:09.492 --> 32:10.401
I'm not furious.

32:10.402 --> 32:11.601
I'm just talking louder.

32:11.602 --> 32:12.812
Have your breakfast.

32:28.812 --> 32:29.641
Luo Quan!

32:29.642 --> 32:33.091
Didn't I tell you,
don't contact my family anymore,

32:33.092 --> 32:34.332
don't you understand?

32:40.092 --> 32:41.092
Mom...

32:42.122 --> 32:43.851
I thought it was Luo Quan.

32:43.852 --> 32:45.922
Why didn't you use your phone?

32:47.572 --> 32:48.921
You don't want to fetch it.

32:48.922 --> 32:51.372
Would you talk with Hulu?

32:51.732 --> 32:52.092
Come on.

32:52.092 --> 32:52.731
Hulu, Hulu.

32:52.732 --> 32:53.292
Grandma.

32:53.292 --> 32:54.292
Hurry up.

32:56.852 --> 32:58.531
Grandma, I'm having breakfast.

32:58.532 --> 32:59.852
Do you miss me?

33:00.882 --> 33:02.251
You don't have to miss me.

33:02.252 --> 33:05.852
My mom said that
she would send me to you on vacation.

33:06.092 --> 33:07.852
I have social engagement today.

33:08.332 --> 33:09.552
She has social engagement?

33:09.882 --> 33:11.851
Today is my friend Hu's birthday,

33:11.852 --> 33:14.162
so I have to social this noon.

33:15.092 --> 33:16.331
Honghong is going back to Guangzhou,

33:16.332 --> 33:17.731
so she wants to hold the party in advance.

33:17.732 --> 33:18.491
Look at her...

33:18.492 --> 33:19.921
She is busier than the director.

33:19.922 --> 33:21.772
Okay, I'll pass the phone to grandma.

33:22.922 --> 33:23.922
Me?

33:30.252 --> 33:31.252
Shuyu.

33:31.362 --> 33:32.051
We're good.

33:32.052 --> 33:33.612
You too?

33:38.122 --> 33:39.851
Why didn't you use your phone?

33:39.852 --> 33:42.011
She must be asking mom to persuade Luo to date.

33:42.012 --> 33:43.012
Interesting.

33:46.602 --> 33:47.162
Sorry, sorry.

33:47.162 --> 33:48.162
I'm wrong, I'm wrong.

33:53.052 --> 33:54.642
Don't contact him anymore.

34:11.402 --> 34:13.132
What's wrong, Xiaochun?

34:14.332 --> 34:15.332
What?

34:16.732 --> 34:23.892
Your face is like a yaksha.

34:28.522 --> 34:31.401
It's about a relative of mine.

34:31.402 --> 34:36.731
A distressing relative always calls us.

34:36.732 --> 34:39.481
My mom was even asked
to persuade her son to date.

34:39.482 --> 34:41.202
Really annoying.

34:43.402 --> 34:45.291
That means you two are good.

34:45.292 --> 34:47.291
Only people in good relations would do this.

34:47.292 --> 34:48.611
Who wants good relations with him?

34:48.612 --> 34:50.481
Go! Go!

34:50.482 --> 34:51.482
As far as he can!

34:58.362 --> 35:00.162
We still have one dessert to make.

35:03.732 --> 35:05.811
This is the cafe where Nana works.

35:05.812 --> 35:07.081
It's quite good.

35:07.082 --> 35:08.811
So I didn't stay at home all the time.

35:08.812 --> 35:10.001
I go out.

35:10.002 --> 35:13.362
Hongdou and Nana went out with me
for a whole day yesterday.

35:14.082 --> 35:17.282
How could you girls go to the bar?
It's a ghetto.

35:17.812 --> 35:19.361
It's not.

35:19.362 --> 35:23.251
Mr. Hu is a good singer in our yard.

35:23.252 --> 35:25.361
It's a sober bar run by his friends.

35:25.362 --> 35:28.282
It's a place only for people to listen to songs.

35:29.562 --> 35:30.562
Nana is here.

35:31.042 --> 35:32.291
Let me introduce.

35:32.292 --> 35:33.512
My father and mother.

35:34.482 --> 35:35.132
Hello.

35:35.132 --> 35:36.202
Hello uncle and aunt.

35:36.442 --> 35:37.481
Hello, hello.

35:37.482 --> 35:38.481
Hello, Nana.

35:38.482 --> 35:41.722
Thank you for holding
the birthday party for Qingtian.

35:42.332 --> 35:43.771
You're welcome.

35:43.772 --> 35:45.521
Damai helps me a lot.

35:45.522 --> 35:47.651
She always makes midnight snacks for me.

35:47.652 --> 35:49.291
She knows to take care of others!

35:49.292 --> 35:50.292
She is good at it!

35:50.812 --> 35:53.771
Nana, does she go out ordinarily?

35:53.772 --> 35:55.851
Yes, of course, I do.

35:55.852 --> 35:58.762
You go out?

35:59.252 --> 36:00.171
Yes, she does.

36:00.172 --> 36:01.642
I take her out.

36:02.332 --> 36:02.922
Okay, okay.

36:02.923 --> 36:04.211
Just stop here.

36:04.212 --> 36:05.331
I will start writing.

36:05.332 --> 36:06.811
It's enough for you to see me on facetime.

36:06.812 --> 36:07.291
I'll hang up.

36:07.292 --> 36:10.401
Stand up and relax after an hour of writing.

36:10.402 --> 36:11.771
Do eye exercises.

36:11.772 --> 36:13.361
I know, I did.

36:13.362 --> 36:16.331
Besides, destiny ties people together.

36:16.332 --> 36:19.452
People who are good to you are your saviors.

36:19.812 --> 36:21.162
It's hard to find.

36:21.522 --> 36:24.092
You guys get along well with each other.
Don't quarrel.

36:25.442 --> 36:26.691
I get it, Teacher Zhou.

36:26.692 --> 36:28.361
Me too, Teacher Zhou.

36:28.362 --> 36:29.651
Fine, bye.

36:29.652 --> 36:30.972
Okay, I'll hang up, bye.

36:33.252 --> 36:34.521
The class is over finally.

36:34.522 --> 36:35.532
Have lunch now.

36:37.212 --> 36:38.212
Nana.

36:39.812 --> 36:40.651
Let me have a look there.

36:40.652 --> 36:41.331
Okay.

36:41.332 --> 36:42.332
Nana.

36:43.962 --> 36:44.962
What?

36:47.332 --> 36:52.412
Let me pick you up when I am free.

36:54.692 --> 36:59.052
Just like my parents said,
I should come out more.

37:00.212 --> 37:02.331
Are you kidding me?

37:02.332 --> 37:03.412
Can you have free time?

37:04.362 --> 37:06.361
I can do it.

37:06.362 --> 37:07.612
I will try to make it.

37:08.132 --> 37:09.521
Really?

37:09.522 --> 37:10.682
Yes.

37:15.522 --> 37:18.242
Do you know how the wind comes?

37:19.812 --> 37:22.762
The hot air comes to the cold area,

37:23.172 --> 37:25.251
and the cold place would get warm.

37:25.252 --> 37:29.521
When it gets warm,
then it should flow to new places,

37:29.522 --> 37:30.892
and new wind direction appears.

37:33.882 --> 37:35.481
What does it mean?

37:35.482 --> 37:38.762
What does it do with wind direction?

37:40.522 --> 37:49.772
I mean that you come to me,

37:50.522 --> 37:53.202
and I will come to you.

37:53.922 --> 37:56.452
I will be good to you, be better to you.

38:00.522 --> 38:05.492
Then I came to you,
we have the same temperature.

38:05.812 --> 38:07.492
How could you come to me?

38:09.332 --> 38:10.332
Silly girl.

38:11.732 --> 38:14.472
But no matter what,
I'd like to say thank you.

38:14.852 --> 38:16.492
I will be better to you too.

38:18.042 --> 38:19.042
I'll go now.

38:25.002 --> 38:26.162
This one.

39:28.562 --> 39:29.562
Xu Hongdou!

39:37.212 --> 39:38.251
I'm coming!

39:38.252 --> 39:38.881
It's okay.

39:38.882 --> 39:39.651
There's no rush.

39:39.652 --> 39:40.652
Take your time.

39:42.172 --> 39:42.692
There's no rush.

39:42.692 --> 39:43.762
Take your time.

39:44.042 --> 39:45.452
But you shout under my window.

39:45.732 --> 39:46.732
Merchant.

39:46.772 --> 39:47.792
Totally a merchant.

39:52.132 --> 39:53.132
Let's go.

39:53.482 --> 39:54.611
Just woke up?

39:54.612 --> 39:55.802
No, I was washing clothes.

39:56.482 --> 39:57.308
Fine.

39:57.332 --> 39:58.332
Did you eat?

39:58.732 --> 40:00.232
I just had breakfast with Nana.

40:03.362 --> 40:04.792
What are you laughing at?

40:05.212 --> 40:06.771
I was born with this smiling mouth.

40:06.772 --> 40:08.242
I look nice.

40:08.772 --> 40:13.771
Then you have to know that looking nice
has nothing to do with handsome.

40:13.772 --> 40:15.362
You can only set one character.

40:16.172 --> 40:19.092
Pony Prince sounds good, okay?

40:20.852 --> 40:23.001
Let me talk about
the personnel of the warehouse.

40:23.002 --> 40:24.242
First is Auntie Feng.

40:24.522 --> 40:26.572
She is a customer service executive.

40:26.852 --> 40:30.492
She is righteous, and frugal.

40:30.772 --> 40:33.572
It's hard for her to change her personality.

40:34.652 --> 40:36.492
Then don't let her do that job.

40:37.332 --> 40:38.291
Ask others to do it.

40:38.292 --> 40:40.642
Ask her to deliver the goods.

40:41.212 --> 40:43.171
As a customer service executive,
the working hours are long.

40:43.172 --> 40:44.961
She has to send messages after work.

40:44.962 --> 40:48.412
But it gets higher pay than other work.

40:48.772 --> 40:53.131
She learned to type for this job.

40:53.132 --> 40:54.851
Then she became capable of this job.

40:54.852 --> 40:56.842
The most important one is that
she is quite dedicated.

40:57.362 --> 40:59.691
I'm not speaking ill of others.

40:59.692 --> 41:02.552
But no one else is better than
Auntie Feng.

41:03.362 --> 41:05.842
I never saw a boss like you.

41:06.402 --> 41:07.731
This is the village.

41:07.732 --> 41:12.162
They always say that they saw me naked
when I was young.

41:12.402 --> 41:14.611
They like to talk about
your embarrassed history.

41:14.612 --> 41:16.352
You have no prestige in front of them.

41:17.172 --> 41:18.172
Okay.

41:18.652 --> 41:21.162
I can try to change Auntie Feng's idea.

41:22.172 --> 41:23.651
You can do it, Manager Xu.

41:23.652 --> 41:24.651
I believe you.

41:24.652 --> 41:25.652
I'll try my best.

41:26.212 --> 41:27.322
You are being humble.

41:28.362 --> 41:29.362
Are you okay?

41:37.332 --> 41:38.412
Manager Xu.

41:39.212 --> 41:40.472
Come here and check on this.

41:41.612 --> 41:43.731
It asks for a refund because it's not delicious.

41:43.732 --> 41:45.242
Can I do that?

41:46.082 --> 41:47.082
See?

41:50.522 --> 41:51.522
Refund a half.

41:51.612 --> 41:52.642
Refund a half?

41:53.332 --> 41:54.401
The guest is not satisfied.

41:54.402 --> 41:56.291
Then we will make them happy.

41:56.292 --> 41:58.331
We can't do a losing business.

41:58.332 --> 41:59.492
Manager.

42:00.332 --> 42:01.361
Auntie Feng.

42:01.362 --> 42:04.492
The business has profit and loss.

42:04.882 --> 42:08.291
We should think from the angle of our guests.

42:08.292 --> 42:10.012
We should meet their needs.

42:10.482 --> 42:12.041
Actually, the goods return is fine for us.

42:12.042 --> 42:13.492
We have return insurance.

42:13.732 --> 42:17.642
As long as the goods are fine,
we can sell them again.

42:18.562 --> 42:20.331
I checked these comments.

42:20.332 --> 42:24.092
Most of them are saying that
it's hard to refund,

42:24.362 --> 42:25.731
and the package is not good.

42:25.732 --> 42:27.361
And the delivery.

42:27.362 --> 42:30.561
They put the goods at the
depository without calling guests.

42:30.562 --> 42:32.412
And the taste is not good.

42:33.002 --> 42:35.521
You don't like it, he likes it.

42:35.522 --> 42:37.481
I never heard that one can
get refunded because one dislikes it.

42:37.482 --> 42:39.131
That's too much.

42:39.132 --> 42:40.132
Auntie Feng.

42:40.812 --> 42:42.331
As long as the guest is not satisfied,

42:42.332 --> 42:43.691
the comments would be bad.

42:43.692 --> 42:44.171
No...

42:44.172 --> 42:47.492
It will affect the new customers
and the repurchase rate.

42:48.652 --> 42:50.242
If we provide a good service,

42:50.482 --> 42:54.892
he would like to come again
even if he is not satisfied this time.

42:55.852 --> 42:58.561
As for the comment,
he would speak highly of our service.

42:58.562 --> 42:59.691
It's quite fast.

42:59.692 --> 43:03.282
Basically, good service
leads to a positive cycle.

43:04.252 --> 43:07.762
Importunate guests are uncommon after all.

43:08.332 --> 43:11.731
To make our guests satisfied is our purpose.

43:11.732 --> 43:12.851
If the customers feel good,

43:12.852 --> 43:14.512
then they would be our regular customers.

43:15.692 --> 43:19.079
Hongdou, when you were the hotel manager,

43:19.080 --> 43:21.242
did you ever meet any unreasonable guests?

43:21.772 --> 43:23.642
Of course.

43:24.172 --> 43:27.972
Once a guest called the room service
to check out,

43:28.332 --> 43:31.972
he was so bad-tempered that
he poured a cup of ice coffee on my face.

43:32.482 --> 43:34.851
Another one,
a mosquito flew into his room,

43:34.852 --> 43:37.731
I was scolded by a naked man for an hour.

43:37.732 --> 43:39.052
All naked?

43:39.522 --> 43:42.012
How could it be?

43:42.332 --> 43:43.842
You can even bear this?

43:44.212 --> 43:45.212
Yes.

43:45.852 --> 43:47.152
Xu Hongdou.

43:53.912 --> 43:55.081
She has a big picture.

43:55.082 --> 43:56.611
That's why she is the manager.

43:56.612 --> 43:57.612
Yes.

